                                            "A portion of a book or document, incorporated distinctly in another work; a citation; a quotation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e3a43d0-0bbb-4381-b904-104cb49e2f16",
                                                "sense_id": "ca48e5e2-14c4-3c8d-8479-4fefe4205607",
                                                "text": "I used an extract of Hemingway's book to demonstrate culture shock."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf6128b0-240e-36f9-8a2e-a30e252d9895",
                                        "entry_id": "4a996bfe-9fd2-30a3-8c2a-347def0942b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A decoction, solution, or infusion made by drawing out from any substance that which gives it its essential and characteristic virtue"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c9ebd82-1399-4406-bc07-edf8d158d4fe",
                                                "sense_id": "bf6128b0-240e-36f9-8a2e-a30e252d9895",
                                                "text": "vanilla extract"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ae7c2b6-aedb-4769-9013-2a9343e60df0",
                                                "sense_id": "bf6128b0-240e-36f9-8a2e-a30e252d9895",
                                                "text": "extract of beef"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3321fb29-8b4b-432e-ab3e-ddff57d37961",
                                                "sense_id": "bf6128b0-240e-36f9-8a2e-a30e252d9895",
                                                "text": "extract of dandelion"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5cee35ec-9335-3e4c-a5f9-1f6f539775b8",
                                        "entry_id": "4a996bfe-9fd2-30a3-8c2a-347def0942b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any substance extracted is such a way, and characteristic of that from which it is obtained"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58538f28-9ca4-4f31-90ae-e870349d3f6f",
                                                "sense_id": "5cee35ec-9335-3e4c-a5f9-1f6f539775b8",
                                                "text": "quinine is the most important extract of Peruvian bark."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de044918-5192-31ee-a82c-68c14bd71544",
                                        "entry_id": "4a996bfe-9fd2-30a3-8c2a-347def0942b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A solid preparation obtained by evaporating a solution of a drug, etc., or the fresh juice of a plant (distinguished from an abstract)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f8ab50a-5091-3d60-94eb-0ebb9a80aaee",
                                        "entry_id": "4a996bfe-9fd2-30a3-8c2a-347def0942b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A peculiar principle (fundamental essence) once erroneously supposed to form the basis of all vegetable extracts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4850545f-9ce3-3468-a785-b8041848acd7",
                                        "entry_id": "4a996bfe-9fd2-30a3-8c2a-347def0942b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ancestry; descent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c4b9687-833c-312e-b0a1-512872d823ff",
                                        "entry_id": "4a996bfe-9fd2-30a3-8c2a-347def0942b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A draft or copy of writing; a certified copy of the proceedings in an action and the judgment therein, with an order for execution."
                                        ],
